OL,3,GNEWSA'Poor care' risks at mental health
OL,4,Atrust, says CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS mental health trust has been
OL,7,Ftold its leadership must improve as
OL,8,Fpatients were not always protected from
OL,9,Fthe risks of poor care.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) found
OL,12,FKent and Medway Mental Health NHS Trust
OL,13,Fwas not "properly involving or
OL,14,Fsupporting families and carers after
OL,15,Fserious incidents".
OL,17,FIt also said "local system pressures
OL,18,Fmeant that the majority of people ready
OL,19,Ffor discharge did not have appropriate
OL,20,Faccommodation to be discharged to".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
